WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
I got some wild goods at home

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:02,440
Section Chief Gao said he was interested before

3
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,960
Unit 3, second floor, left hand side

4
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,720
Keep your voice down. It's not time to go to work yet.

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:12,730
Thank you sir, who is it?

6
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:14,170
Section Chief Gao, it’s me

7
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:15,610
The guy who was selling wild boar meat a few days ago

8
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,300
Little brother, sit down quickly

9
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,420
There are good things for coming so early.

10
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,540
fresh wild boar

11
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:27,860
Not long after he died

12
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,780
fat thick

13
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,740
The net meat is estimated to be 200 or several dozen kilograms.

14
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,710
where is the thing

15
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:33,830
I didn’t dare to take him into the city

16
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:36,070
Put it in a stable place outside the city for you to inspect.

17
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,180
Behind the old flour mill in the west of the city

18
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,100
The wall has openings and the place is empty

19
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,420
See you in an hour

20
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,260
I compete with three-wheeled trucks

21
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,300
Bring two people

22
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,340
As long as the goods are good

23
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,700
The price makes you satisfied
